I-I think I'm... I'm good with coffee.

287
00:17:32,677 --> 00:17:34,596
Counter if it's just coffee.

288
00:17:34,679 --> 00:17:36,765
♪ Telling you how to shake that thing ♪

289
00:17:38,933 --> 00:17:41,269
♪ Well, Grandpapa Johnson
grabbed sister Kate...

290
00:17:41,352 --> 00:17:43,855
We won't be long.

291
00:17:45,648 --> 00:17:47,192
♪ They were shaking that thing...

292
00:17:47,275 --> 00:17:48,902
Do you have any idea what happened?

293
